# ============================================================================
# Unity public source-only repository .gitignore
#
# Purpose:
#   Publish self-authored source code while excluding third-party/licensed
#   assets, binary content, scenes, prefabs, plugins, generated files, secrets,
#   and local machine settings.
#
# Place this file in the Unity project root, beside Assets/, Packages/,
# and ProjectSettings/.
# ============================================================================

